# tests/code/t2/t2.rxt — the T2 check (docs/design/inline_c.md §5.7): a code
# segment in a section WITHOUT the opt-in. This directory has no
# harness.manifest, so the harness compiles the block with no grant and pcrec
# must refuse it; the block expects that refusal (`perr`). Sabotage S-IC9
# (the opt-in check removed) compiles the segment and this block goes red.
pattern a(?C`c: return RX_PASS;`)b
perr

# ...and `features all` does not grant it either (S-IC28).
pattern a(?C`c: return RX_PASS;`)b
features all
perr
